    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> once per turn, you can designate a single <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> within your line of sight whose <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot_(Vehicle_Combat)\" title=\"Pilot (Vehicle Combat)\">Pilot</a> can hear and understand you. That Pilot's Vehicle ignores <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Difficult_Terrain\" title=\"Difficult Terrain\">Difficult Terrain</a> until the start of your next turn, and the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot_(Vehicle_Combat)\" title=\"Pilot (Vehicle Combat)\">Pilot</a> gains a +5 insight bonus on all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot\" title=\"Pilot\">Pilot</a> checks made to avoid <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Collisions\" title=\"Collisions\">Collisions</a> until the start of your next turn.",
